OL,3,ACreate more jobs for under-25s by
OL,4,Acutting National Insurance, key report
OL,5,Aurges
OL,6,
OL,7,FCollette Osborne, a hairdresser who
OL,8,Fowns three salons in Nottingham, said
OL,9,Fshe feels "suffocated by employment
OL,10,Fcosts" including NI and while she used
OL,11,Fto employ eight apprentices a year, now
OL,12,Fshe cannot afford to take on any.
